OL,5,G1500 Music Matters: Outside In
OL,6,     FClive Myrie talks with people of
OL,7,     Fcolour about their experiences of
OL,8,     Fbeing classical musicians. How
OL,9,     Fwere they first attracted to
OL,10,     Fclassical music and how did their
OL,11,     Fcareers begin?
OL,12,G1600 Jazz Record Requests
OL,13,     FAlyn Shipton presents jazz records
OL,14,     Fof all styles as requested by you,
OL,15,     Fincluding cuts Stan Tracey,
OL,16,     FBlossom Dearie, Laufey, Dave
OL,17,     FHolland and more.
