OL,5,G1700 The Early Music Show
OL,6,     FHannah French explores the life of
OL,7,     FQueen Christina of Sweden, who was
OL,8,     Fborn 400 years ago this year and
OL,9,     Fbecame one of the most important
OL,10,     Fmusical benefactors in Rome.
OL,11,G1800 Choral Evensong
OL,12,     FLive from Westminster Abbey to
OL,13,     Fmark the 100th anniversary of BBC
OL,14,     FChoral Evensong broadcasts.
OL,15,G1900 Sunday Feature: The Man Who...
OL,16,     F...Played The Kremlin's Tune. Lucy
OL,17,     FAsh charts the rise and rule of
OL,18,     FSoviet composer Tikhon Khrennikov
OL,19,     F- Stalin's enforcer in the world
OL,20,     Fof music.
