OL,5,G1945 Words and Music
OL,6,     FJohn Telfer, who plays Reverend
OL,7,     FAlan Franks in Radio 4's The
OL,8,     FArchers, and Debbie Korley are the
OL,9,     Freaders in an episode marking the
OL,10,     Fhundredth anniversary of Choral
OL,11,     FEvensong.
OL,12,G2100 Brass Banding with Hannah Peel
OL,13,     FHannah meets a history-making
OL,14,     Fadjudicator and learns how to
OL,15,     Fchoose a winner. Plus a concept
OL,16,     Fconcert telling the dramatic story
OL,17,     Fof Igor Stravinsky's The Rite of
OL,18,     FSpring.
